<newsitem itemid="153419" id="root" date="1996-10-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lion Nathan reports NZ$150.4 mln yr net.</title>
<headline>Lion Nathan reports NZ$150.4 mln yr net.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Aug 31.</p>
<p>(million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 150.4 vs 202.3</p>
<p>    Earnings from operations	     246.6 vs 231.2</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 28.4 vs 39.1</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  8.0 vs 8.0 </p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		16.0 vs 16.0 </p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		     1.757 vs 1.772</p>
<p>    Abnormals			    debit 6.5 vs debit 15.18</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    224.4 vs 200.3 </p>
<p>    Tax				   debit 74.2 vs credit 1.82</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	547.67 vs same</p>
<p>    Balance sheet (in millions unless stated)</p>
<p>    Current assets			   353.7 vs 369.3</p>
<p>    Total assets (billion)		  3.74 vs 3.80 </p>
<p>    Current liabilities		    459.2 vs 584.5</p>
<p>    Total liabilities (billion)	   1.77 vs 1.96</p>
<p>    Shareholders' equity		    1.95 vs 1.91</p>
<p>    Cashflow from operating activities 286.4 vs 272.3</p>
<p>    Cashflow from investing activities(49.6) vs (27.2)</p>
<p>    Dividend carries nil imputation credit. (Note interim 8.0 cps dividend was 70 percent imputed)</p>
<p>    Pay date Dec 12</p>
<p>    Reg date Nov 29 </p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec  2</p>
<p>    Note - Lion Nathan is an Australasian brewer with 75 percent of its assets in Australia.</p>
<p>    -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
